{"about_the_game":"Get a great start to your day with crispy, nutritious platforming! Embark on an a-maize-ing adventure as a team of happy-go-lucky cereal flakes on a quest to recover the legendary Cornucopia.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be More Spoontaneous!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023560/extras/251d5cc0609f29d4a7cc57c83f2dfd3c.avif?t=1599032426\" width=596 height=116 /></span><br>Swap between a wide variety of playable cornflakes with unique abilities and attributes as you traverse 2D platforming worlds bursting with colour, humour, and weird characters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cornquer the Grub Kingdom</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023560/extras/bc98fad5412a1898c308e58549b23108.avif?t=1599032426\" width=596 height=116 /></span><br>Explore all sorts of food-inspired environments filled with wonder and really stupid puns, including the Broccoli Forest, the Dessert Dungeon and a Haunted Gingerbread House!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reclaim the Cornucopia</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023560/extras/828e95be9081f421c1b013563ee163d0.avif?t=1599032426\" width=596 height=116 /></span><br>The ancient relic that ensures the peace and tranquility of the cornflake lifestyle has been seized by a mysterious newcomer named Bandit - don\u2019t let him get away with it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corny and hand-drawn-y</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023560/extras/d5684be903dc5626ebfdde69a7b152af.avif?t=1599032426\" width=596 height=116 /></span><br>A painstaking, entirely hand-illustrated game made as the result of more than two years of love and dedication from a solo developer!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cob A Load Of 